## Step 2 — `_form.scss` `.is-current` 버튼 shimmer

**파일:** `resource/scss/components/_form.scss`

### 2a. `.is-current &__button` 블록 교체 (line 784–786)

현재:
```scss
&-overview__item.is-current &-overview__button {
  transform: translateX(fluid(2, 4));
}
```

변경:
```scss
&-overview__item.is-current &-overview__button {
  transform: translateX(fluid(2, 4));
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 14%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 5%, transparent);

  &::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 30%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(
      105deg,
      transparent 0%,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 9%, transparent) 50%,
      transparent 100%
    );
    transform: translateX(-200%) skewX(-12deg);
    animation: no-wizard-overview-shimmer 4s ease-in-out 0.4s infinite;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
}
```

### 2b. `@keyframes` 추가 — 기존 chip keyframes 블록 근처 (line ~1048)

```scss
@keyframes no-wizard-overview-shimmer {
  0% {
    transform: translateX(-200%) skewX(-12deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  8% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  28% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  36%, 100% {
    transform: translateX(450%) skewX(-12deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}
```

동작: 4초 주기 중 첫 ~1.4s(0–36%)에 스윕 완료 → 나머지 ~2.6s 정지(invisible). button `overflow: hidden`이 좌우 클리핑 처리. `skewX(-12deg)`로 빛 반사 각도 표현. `pointer-events: none` → 클릭 방해 없음.

